# TypeScript
*.tsbuildinfo

# Uploaded media files (real, disk-stored assets referenced by the `media`
# table's storage_path -- the directory itself is tracked via .gitkeep so it
# always exists, but its contents are per-environment, not source.
uploads/media/*
!uploads/media/.gitkeep